# The librust-*-dev entries are generated:
#   scripts/debian.py packages --control Packages.xz \
#     --baseline oldstable/Packages.xz --baseline stable/Packages.xz
# (Debian testing's index first), which lists every crate dependency of every
# workspace crate that the archive can satisfy; debian/rules drops the rest
# (oxc, ts-rs, three tree-sitter grammars, fresh-gui) from the manifests.
